 * - solid: Produces a solid line.
 * - spelling-error: Each line of text uses the user agents' method of highlighting spelling
 * mistakes, which is a dotted red line in most browsers. See
 * https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-decoration-line
 * - underline: Each line of text is underlined.
